WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Auto Reply”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Send a message
Write the step name and the message text, and set what follows from “Link to step”.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Send an image
Upload an image from the file field, add an optional caption, then choose what follows.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Send a video
Upload a video that suits the channel and the limit shown, add a description, then what follows.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Send a document
Upload the document you need and add a caption if you want, then link it to a next step.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Send a short list
Write the question and add the options; each option has a text and a next step. Use the number the channel accepts.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Send a long list
Use it for more options and link each option to its path. Review the channel's limits before publishing.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Knowledge Base reply
Prepare the questions and answers in the knowledge base. Write the no-match reply and link a follow-up step when needed.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Automatic AI reply
Requires your account's AI provider key and a knowledge base. It sends the reply automatically; link a hand-over to an employee for when there is no answer.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Show the catalog
Add the products from the Catalog and set the intro message. The next step is used when an employee is requested or there are no products.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Nearest branch
Prepare the branch data and write the location request message. The bot sends the nearest branch according to the customer's location.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Transfer to a team
Choose an existing team. This is a final step that moves the conversation to the team with no automatic follow-up afterwards.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:36.000
Transfer to an employee
Choose the specific employee. Prepare the employee and their permissions first; this is a final step.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:47.000
Close the conversation
You can write an optional closing message and then close the conversation. Don't link it to a next step.
